OL,3,GNEWSAArrest in connection with Pokemon
OL,4,Acards raid
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested in connection
OL,7,Fwith the theft of thousands of pounds
OL,8,Fworth of Pokemon cards in Lincolnshire.
OL,10,FThe break-in happened at Trading Cards
OL,11,FGainsborough shortly after 03:15 BST on
OL,12,FSunday 9 August.
OL,14,FCCTV filmed two people getting into the
OL,15,FLord Street shop through a smashed
OL,16,Fwindow.
OL,18,FLincolnshire Police said a man was
OL,19,Farrested on Monday in connection with
OL,20,Fthe incident and remained in custody
OL,21,Ffor questioning.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
